  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Character level 3rd.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefits:</strong> Whenever you consume a drug and succeed at your saving throw to avoid addiction, you do not suffer ability damage from that drug. You still suffer other secondary negative effects, if any.</p>\n<p>If consuming catnip (see section Recreational Substances for Cats in <a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/alchemical-items\">Alchemical Items</a>), you instead avoid the secondary effects of the catnip.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc12\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
